{"c":"453054","n":"ORLICE DIVOKÁ 1 P","t":"P","s":"VČ","o":"Lípa nad Orlicí","url":"453054-orlice-divoka-1-p","stav":"2026-10-04","popis":"Revír tvoří úsek náhonu Alba–Dědina od mlýna v Týništi nad Orlicí až k pile v Česticích. K revíru patří Zlatý (Olešnický) potok (GPS Z: 50°7'44.229\"N, 16°8'50.153\"E, K: 50°10'56.427\"N, 16°11'4.297\"E) od soutoku s Divokou Orlicí až k pramenům. Součástí revíru je potok Brodec (GPS Z: 50°6'59.7\"N, 16°8'8.099\"E, K: 50°3'48.935\"N, 16°14'21.803\"E) od soutoku s Divokou Orlicí až k rybníku v obci Borovnice. Úsek Zlatého potoka od soutoku s Divokou Orlicí až po stavidla v Česticích a potok Brodec od rybníka v obci Borovnice jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán. Ostatní přítoky jsou chovné – lov ryb zakázán.","delka":28,"rozloha":6,"lat":50.122967,"lon":16.160881,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/lipa-nad-orlici","mo_tel":"725 046 877","mo_mail":"","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":70,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":25,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":fal